{"schemaVersion":"galpedia-static-detail-model-v1","dataRevision":"a0c0367b8270b080feef0ef1fe65522144dc62343feb9d752729d92867d0d639","workId":"35425","model":{"presentationWorkId":"egs:35425","staff":{"artwork":[{"creditedName":"祁答院慎","creatorId":"vndb:s2313","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:29511","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s2313","name":"祁答院慎","roleCode":"artwork","roleLabel":"原画","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-creator:273947","source":"egs"}],"scenario":[{"creditedName":"祁答院慎","creatorId":"vndb:s2313","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:29511","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s2313","name":"祁答院慎","roleCode":"scenario","roleLabel":"剧本","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-creator:273950","source":"egs"}],"music":[{"creditedName":"濱本麻央","creatorId":"vndb:s2312","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:29512","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s2312","name":"濱本麻央","roleCode":"music","roleLabel":"作品音乐","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-creator:273949","source":"egs"}],"other":[]},"cast":[{"characterId":"char_bangumi_130779","characterName":"如月学園高等部","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"130779","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"19388"},{"characterId":"130779","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"424334"},{"characterId":"130779","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"435666"},{"characterId":"130779","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"45413"},{"characterId":"130779","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"72042"}]},"originalCharacterName":"如月学園高等部","characterNameSource":null,"role":"客串","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"学校法人如月学園の校章。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「如月」とは旧暦の２月。校章は２月に咲く花「梅」をモチーフにしている。梅の花は『希望』、蕾は『忍耐』、枝は『絆』を表している。高等部のリボンの色は青。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"130779"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/bc/bccf35a3fe0780489b9fb72ab2ec1d2ebeee920a9244627e218ec4b972b953ce.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a5/a5ddb7717b05870bc6c975d2f47b6a6e8c23a2f14a87cf5b173a2960818ecb96.webp","width":200,"height":230,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_130780","characterName":"如月学園中等部","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"130780","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"19388"},{"characterId":"130780","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"424334"},{"characterId":"130780","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"435666"},{"characterId":"130780","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"45413"},{"characterId":"130780","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"72042"}]},"originalCharacterName":"如月学園中等部","characterNameSource":null,"role":"客串","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"同じく如月学園の校章。中等部のリボンの色は赤。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"130780"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/19/1965dace8bb33e7915585a6c43b6e5a72b90e8d5ae5725e40d3493427d7105aa.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ce/cecbb3db97748a156a78a6dcd4f8b4f06006323fcdc8908fd1c50b0a4e0ec5e6.webp","width":200,"height":230,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_130784","characterName":"てんじんしょうがっこう","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"130784","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"19388"},{"characterId":"130784","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"424334"},{"characterId":"130784","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"435666"},{"characterId":"130784","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"45413"},{"characterId":"130784","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"72042"}]},"originalCharacterName":"てんじんしょうがっこう","characterNameSource":null,"role":"客串","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"天神小学为谜之红衣少女篠崎幸子强大的怨念所制造的异次元空间。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"空间的具现化正是发生于二十年前的绑架惨案的所在地，天神小学。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"天小事件发生的更深层原因"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"55年前，天神小学德高望重、受人尊敬的校长柳堀隆峰兽性大发，试图性侵年轻貌美的保健老师篠崎芳惠。柳堀隆峰在追赶篠崎芳惠的途中，将篠崎芳惠推下楼梯。篠崎芳惠摔断脖子，当场死亡。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"篠崎芳惠的女儿篠崎幸子目睹了这一切。柳堀隆峰为了掩盖罪行，掐死了篠崎幸子，并将篠崎幸子的尸体掩埋于地下室，制造出篠崎芳惠是死于意外的假象。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"20年前，著名的天神小学绑架案发生。天神小学校的校长的儿子，犯罪嫌疑人柳堀义雄将三名小学生残忍杀害，只有篠崎幸子活下来。这一切只是篠崎幸子的阴谋，柳堀义雄只是帮凶，因为母亲的愿望，幸子让更多的孩子成为祭品。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"天神小学的怨念越来越强，不断有孩子失踪。最后天神小学被迫废除关闭。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"后来，如月学园在天神小学的原址上建成了。但天神小学的怨念始终存在。鬼碑忌コウ作为职业撰稿人，对天神小学当年的事件很感兴趣，决定回到天神小学调查。他求助于仰慕他多时的通灵少女冴之木七星，找到去往天神小学的方法。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"七星告诉鬼碑忌コウ方法后，并给了他从篠崎幸子家找到的纸人幸福的幸子小姐。但鬼碑忌コウ抛下了七星，和助手田九地前往天神小学。冴之木七星知道鬼碑忌コウ这种并不通灵的人去的后果，担心她所喜欢的老师再也回不来了。她憎恨自己，也憎恨他人，邪念也慢慢在心中产生，把“幸福的幸子小姐”作为一种祈福方式放在BLOG，并告知以错误的方法，她要让更多人进去天神小学陪葬。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"慢慢的，因为死的人越多，怨气越重，篠崎幸子所创造的空间力量愈发强大，要超度篠崎幸子的难度也变得很大。所以进去天神小学的很少有人能活着出来（加之，人呆在天神小学会黑化，猜疑并杀害他人）。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"130784"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/98/98df8264c538ff93262060be1ecc747a492fca5c48d3d24f4eeded0c81c121da.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/cb/cb57381304d948592c98828450b020bc4d9e0d3b57a3f31913033d4511a0abbd.webp","width":256,"height":181,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_20825","characterName":"もちだ さとし","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"20825","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"19388"},{"characterId":"20825","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"424334"},{"characterId":"20825","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"435666"},{"characterId":"20825","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"45413"},{"characterId":"20825","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"72042"}]},"originalCharacterName":"もちだ さとし","characterNameSource":null,"role":"主角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"17"},"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"0704"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"o"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"168"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"m"},"weight":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"54.2"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"本作的主人公。性格十分胆小，但是性情温柔。总是很在乎妹妹和朋友，遇到麻烦也会认真对待。温厚的性格，总是帮助周围有困难的人，因此在班内自然地成为了领导人物，不过没办法爬到同是女子领袖的中嶋直美头上。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"在《コープスパーティー２》中，成为了大学四年级，22岁的青年。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"为了探望住院的母亲前往慈爱十字病院，却被关了起来。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"20825"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b1/b1bad08545c23b28d445fd773fbe9cc92226c6aef04e97bf20d4b5398f32a9b9.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/4d/4dbc8a983cfffbac3e78c2ef1b9351f61df2df0f1ed18a8c5f937144a4cf8956.webp","width":134,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_20826","characterName":"なかしま なおみ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"20826","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"19388"},{"characterId":"20826","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"424334"},{"characterId":"20826","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"435666"},{"characterId":"20826","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"45413"},{"characterId":"20826","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"72042"}]},"originalCharacterName":"なかしま なおみ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"主角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"16"},"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"1214"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"a"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"158"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"},"weight":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"46.4"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"自中等部以来，一直都是持田哲志的同学，二人总是以その颜、うんざりだよ的方式来打招呼、并互相操心对方的事。看似有着胜于男子的一面，实际上也有擅长料理、钢琴女性的一面。八年前父亲去世，现与母亲中嶋夏海相依为命，快活地过着日子。将来的梦想是女性保育士，为了进专门短期大学，正在努力中。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"20826"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d1/d193ee13f43446f12fef14593826bb0fa0156b7cf96a3aeef572a58646c1c31a.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/89/892fcb9ae32472b6eebb72a0c8d5ad1049aa27b1d50ac545663b94e3ac77cab1.webp","width":119,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_20827","characterName":"きしぬま よしき","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"20827","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"19388"},{"characterId":"20827","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"424334"},{"characterId":"20827","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"435666"},{"characterId":"20827","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"45413"},{"characterId":"20827","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"72042"}]},"originalCharacterName":"きしぬま よしき","characterNameSource":null,"role":"配角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"17"},"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"1108"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"a"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"172"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"m"},"weight":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"62.1"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"性格上有些乖僻经常说出挖苦人的话，是一个表里如一、率直的人。几乎不参加班级内的活动，但如果持田哲志和篠崎あゆみ参加，自己也会悄悄地和他们一起参加。从作为资产家的双亲的基础上使得他志向成为一个杰出人物，像断绝了关系一样走出了家门。由于家庭环境，现在独居住在便宜的公寓里一边打工一边上学，家里只有常常看望他的妹岸沼美树是唯一能理解他的人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"在コープスパーティー2 DEAD PATIENT中头发恢复到了原本应有的黑色，通过W.I维持生计，具体职业不详。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"20827"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f3/f301ec105d434fd9b5f7439d87714330be6e741e4c04251be0371799c11c2ae3.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d8/d8930422ab917132ea8b2c440218a577333cd2eebb8165af7b70dd2c0a3a5cc9.webp","width":127,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_20828","characterName":"しのざき あゆみ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"20828","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"19388"},{"characterId":"20828","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"424334"},{"characterId":"20828","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"435666"},{"characterId":"20828","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"45413"},{"characterId":"20828","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"72042"}]},"originalCharacterName":"しのざき あゆみ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"配角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"17"},"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"0912"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"a"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"151"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"},"weight":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"43.2"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"超级喜欢吓唬别人，经常讲怪谈、鬼故事，对恐怖的故事十分感兴趣。听说她的书包里经常放着怪谈时用的蜡烛。但是，这只不过是为了掩饰她自己内心做出的无意识行为，遇到真正恐怖的事情她会吓得腿软，有着极度胆小的一面，身体不好患有过度呼吸症候群。由于灵媒体质，灵感比普通人强一倍，而且在天神小学校中经常被怨灵附身。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"20828"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/50/50a61f128ba6a41d0e49a23ef4b9fc0c202375bbd19f5565cd86e9142e64f566.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/97/97b80cc8dee4e66f5ac8797a9cee14af706acd9f9c5e7c7462d0559de3d8fe40.webp","width":129,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_20829","characterName":"もちだ ゆか","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"20829","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"19388"},{"characterId":"20829","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"424334"},{"characterId":"20829","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"435666"},{"characterId":"20829","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"45413"},{"characterId":"20829","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"72042"}]},"originalCharacterName":"もちだ ゆか","characterNameSource":null,"role":"配角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"14"},"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"1002"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"a"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"140"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"},"weight":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"34.2"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"文化祭最后一天，外面连续地下雨，雷激烈作响。给兄长持田哲志送伞时来到了如月学校高等部2年9组，并和他们一起施行了幸せのサチコさん的咒术，陷入窘境。兄控属性，性格到现在都还孩子气，常被人搞错年龄。本人极其渴望成长，时常勉强自己模仿大人，似乎总是事与愿违。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"20829"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d1/d149c5afddb2ce60b43bac2daa83f26b5b7152436956d78d5d6149e2e8672f1a.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d5/d5b651cf63a8d702bb93f7f66b74a033200039d0bd3be05e82e1800582c9d79d.webp","width":122,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_20834","characterName":"しのざぎ さちこ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"20834","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"19388"},{"characterId":"20834","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"424334"},{"characterId":"20834","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"435666"},{"characterId":"20834","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"45413"},{"characterId":"20834","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"72042"}]},"originalCharacterName":"しのざぎ さちこ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"配角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"0719"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"a"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"124"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"},"weight":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"21.3"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"1973年儿童连续诱拐杀人事件的唯一幸存者，只有她不是天神小学校的学生。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"20834"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/66/6613bcd81955f0e6b94cd93f324ed1dbaa820f2f9f9dddb2b964294a3eb6a530.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d9/d9559251db38b15c1e1b95603c50c4db7486fc788ceb52fd16e0126e4d0c0d85.webp","width":136,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]}],"songs":[],"companies":[{"companyId":"vndb:p931","sourceCompanyId":"egs:brand:5183","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p931","name":"チームグリグリ","roleCodes":["brand"],"identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work